# TestRewriteCorpus and TestTypedAssertAnalyzer byte-compare linter output
# (go/format, always LF) against committed fixtures and goldens, which are
# packed into these txtar archives. The rule sits here at the testdata/ root,
# not under corpus/, so it also covers typedassert.txtar. Pin every archive to
# LF so a CRLF checkout on Windows does not spuriously fail either test.
*.txtar text eol=lf
